      "text": "WHEREAS, contract management staff at City agencies, such as project manager, in-house engineering and technical staff, labor law investigators, and audit officers, typically monitor compliance with Labor Law during a vendor's performance of a contract and refer vendors to the Comptroller's Office, Bureau of Labor Law for further investigation and enforcement;",
